<p>You fire a toxic shell that explodes in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 3,</acronym> dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">160%, 176%, 189%, 200%, 210%</acronym> weapon damage as acid and leaving behind a cloud of miasma for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 4, 5, 6</acronym> turns that inherits all effects from your Miasma Engine.</p>